\f1\fs22 Word of Sarah's blossoming gestation meandered through the mansion's staff, and reached the eager ears of tour operators. Soon enough, concession stand purveyors\'97peddling an eclectic array of ponchos, leather jackets, a cornucopia of deep-fried anything-you-want, and hair concoctions of vitamin E, jojoba oil, and boot polish\'97were swept up in the whispering winds. From there, scuttlebutt proliferated with the insidious speed of a gas leak, permeating the entire Elvi collective with unrelenting fervor.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>If anything, rumours of the father spread even faster. Weeks before Kathy was prepared to deliver a medical answer to the question vexing Sarah, the wider Elvi populace was convinced the father was the cool cat who accompanied Sarah to the Vegas Show; who had been incarcerated and tortured for Sarah\'92s alleged kidnapping; and who, on prime-time broadcasting, was still protecting the Holy Momma by denying everything.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>In the eyes of the Elvi, Tony was a fucking hero. Yes, a 
\f2\i fucking
\f1\i0  hero; the Elvi opted for this socially more banal alternative, regarding the usual cuss word, 
\f2\i taxing
\f1\i0 , as too blasphemous in the circumstances\'97opted for the socially more banal alternative. So there: Tony was a mother-fucking hero. Thank you very much.\
